            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Fentanyl patch (Durotep patch) is useful analgesic for terminal patients under home care, but the patients family may feel uneasy because they have to determine the induction dose, prepare the rescue drug, and a variety of drug durability.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
